    "| F | 40 | 9 | 1 |\n",
    "| G | 110 | 10 | 1 |\n",
    "| H | 180 | 6 | 1 |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Question:** a new person has income **100** and **8 years** in the job. What is the **chance** that the bank approves?"
   ]
